            "title": "Solve the Rubik's Cube Without Going Crazy! the Ultimate Fool-Proof Solution Guide (in Color) for Children and Adults of All Shapes and Sizes! Includes Follow-Along Video and Mind-Blowing Trivia",
            "authors": [
